<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96519" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στενοχωρ-ία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίη, ἡ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>narrowness of space, a confined
				space</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				14
			</span></i> (codd., but 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στενυγροχωρίη</span>
			)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> ς. τῇ φάρυγγι παρέχειν</span>
			ib. <i><span class="en">
				41
			</span></i>; <i>want of room</i>, by sea or land, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.89
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.26
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				708b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ στενοχωρίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					195a
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐρυχωρία</span> and
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνεσις</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.679f
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				182b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. βίου</span>
			<i>the short space</i> of life <i>remaining</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				2.41
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν λόγον ἀπὸ τῆς ἐκεῖ στενοχωρίας
					εἰς πεδίον ἐξαγάγῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Or.</u>
					64.10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>straits, difficulty</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ς. τοῦ
				ποταμοῦ</span>
			<i>difficulty of passing</i> the river, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				1.3.7
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>De.</u>
				28.53
			</span></i>, al.; <i>distress</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				339.103
			</span></i> (Sestos, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῆς πόλεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					1.67.1
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τοῦ καιροῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					39.34
				</span></i>
			: pl. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>2 Ep.Cor.</u>
				6.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				5.1677.11
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>; also, <i>narrow limits</i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2.220
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i></div>
